ent" style="--reveal-y:16px;--reveal-duration:0.75s;--reveal-delay:0s;--reveal-stagger:0.12s"><h1 class="HeroIllustration-module-scss-module__GI3IHG__eyebrow text-body-2" style="--reveal-index:0">Claude Platform</h1><h2 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-display-2-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance HeroIllustration-module-scss-module__GI3IHG__headline" style="--reveal-index:1">Build frontier agents on the Claude Platform</h2><p class="HeroIllustration-module-scss-module__GI3IHG__subheadline text-body-1" style="--reveal-index:2">Frontier models, harnesses, context management, and infrastructure designed to work together.</p><div class="HeroIllustration-module-scss-module__GI3IHG__ctaGroup" style="--reveal-index:3"><div role="group" class="ButtonGroup-module-scss-module__HSKYlq__buttonGroup HeroIllustration-module-scss-module__GI3IHG__ctas"><a href="https://platform.claude.com/login?utm_source=claude&amp;utm_medium=ref_codr&amp;utm_campaign=dev_acq_gl_cl1p_web_landing_swe_en_signup-platform-bau&amp;utm_content=tri_txt_hero" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-primary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-main text-body-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="heroIllustration" data-cta-url="https://platform.claude.com/login?utm_source=claude&amp;utm_medium=ref_codr&amp;utm_campaign=dev_acq_gl_cl1p_web_landing_swe_en_signup-platform-bau&amp;utm_content=tri_txt_hero">Start building<span class="sr-only" lang="en" data-export-skip=""> (opens in new tab)</span></a><a href="/contact-sales/platform" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-secondary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-main text-body-2" data-cta-position="heroIllustration" data-cta-url="/contact-sales/platform">Contact sales</a></div></div></div><div class="AnimatedReveal-module-scss-module__8zH9eW__container HeroIllustration-module-scss-mo