odule-scss-module___fMNlG__subRows"><dl class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subList"><div class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subRow ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__tierRow"><dt class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subLabel text-caption">Prompts ≤ 100K tokens</dt><dd class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__value text-body-2">$0.10 / MTok</dd></div><div class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subRow ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__tierRow"><dt class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subLabel text-caption">Prompts &gt; 100K tokens</dt><dd class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__value text-body-2">$0.50 / MTok</dd></div></dl></dd></div><div class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__row ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__cacheRow"><dt class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__label text-body-2">Output</dt><dd class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subRows"><dl class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subList"><div class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subRow ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__tierRow"><dt class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subLabel text-caption">Prompts ≤ 100K tokens</dt><dd class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__value text-body-2">$0.50 / MTok</dd></div><div class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subRow ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__tierRow"><dt class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__subLabel text-caption">Prompts &gt; 100K tokens</dt><dd class="ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__value text-body-2">$2.50 / MTok</dd></div></dl></dd></div></dl><a href="https://www.anthropic.com/claude/haiku" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-primary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-main text-body-2 ModelCard-module-scss-module___fMNlG__cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="modelCards" data-cta-url="https://www.anthropic.com/claude/haiku">Explore Haiku<span class="sr-only" lang="en" data-export-skip=""> (opens in new tab)</span></a></div></div></div><div class="text-rich-text ModelCards-module-scss-module__lqrvha__footnotes"><p class="text-body-3"><strong>For workloads that need to run in the US, US-only inference is available at 1.1x pricing for input and output tokens. <a href="https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/data-residency">Learn more</a>.</strong></p><p class="text-body-3">Get up to 2.5x faster speeds with fast mode for Opus 5.5 at 2x standard pricing. <a href="https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing#fast-mode-pricing">Learn more</a>.</p><p class="text-body-3">Prompt caching pricing reflects 5-minute TTL. Learn about <a href="https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-caching#1-hour-cache-duration">extended prompt caching</a>.</p></div></div></section><section id="featureList" data-section="featureList" data-cta-section="featureList" class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__wrapper theme-main"><div class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__borderTop"></div><div class="container"><div class="grid-12"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__inner FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__fullWidth"><div class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__introBlock IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__spacingBelowLarge FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__intro" style="--intro-headline-width:30ch;--intro-text-width:50ch"><div class="Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__base Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__pictogram Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__size-large IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__pictogram" role="img" aria-label="A stylized lightning bolt in beige with decorative patterned elements in black surrounding it, creating a dynamic energy symbol"></div><h2 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-1-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__heading IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__headline IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__headlineBalance" style="--word-stagger:0.06666666666666667s" aria-label="APIs designed for Claude"><span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:0" aria-hidden="true">APIs</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:1" aria-hidden="true">designed</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:2" aria-hidden="true">for</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:3" aria-hidden="true">Claude</span></h2><div class="AnimatedReveal-module-scss-module__8zH9eW__container IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__subheadlineAndCtas" style="--reveal-y:10px;--reveal-duration:0.75s;--reveal-delay:0s;--reveal-stagger:0.1s"><p class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__subheadline text-body-large-2" style="--reveal-index:0">Access Claude’s frontier models through the Messages API to build with full control and customization.</p></div></div><div class="AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__root" data-aside-rails="hidden"><div class="AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__content AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__contentNarrow"><div class="AnimatedReveal-module-scss-module__8zH9eW__container FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__list FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__compact FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__railed FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__iconPrimary" style="--reveal-y:20px;--reveal-duration:0.75s;--reveal-delay:0s;--reveal-stagger:0.1s"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:0"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureLis