="text-body-3">Gives eligible customers the privacy of zero data retention (ZDR) along with state-of-the-art safeguards for detecting misuse.</p></div><div role="group" class="ButtonGroup-module-scss-module__HSKYlq__buttonGroup FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__ctas"><a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/enterprise-frontier-safeguards" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-small text-caption" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="featureList" data-cta-url="https://www.anthropic.com/news/enterprise-frontier-safeguards">Learn more<span class="sr-only" lang="en" data-export-skip=""> (opens in new tab)</span></a></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:1"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.2705 3.0498C11.1054 1.5437 15.4369 3.42942 16.9473 7.26367C18.4585 11.1003 16.5729 15.4359 12.7363 16.9473C8.89982 18.4583 4.56416 16.5736 3.05272 12.7373C1.54288 8.90435 3.42282 4.57201 7.25194 3.05663C7.25547 3.05522 7.25914 3.05413 7.26269 3.05273C7.26523 3.05172 7.26795 3.05079 7.2705 3.0498ZM8.64159 14.5283C8.05764 14.958 7.56418 15.4198 7.17772 15.8896C8.21355 16.3858 9.37633 16.6096 10.5508 16.5098C10.2224 16.2862 9.89754 16.0029 9.58202 15.6748C9.26312 15.3432 8.94744 14.9583 8.64159 14.5283ZM13.1572 12.5351C12.5305 12.6659 11.8818 12.8585 11.2275 13.1162C10.5729 13.3741 9.96666 13.6758 9.41894 14.0078C9.6946 14.3937 9.97385 14.7371 10.2539 15.0283C10.7036 15.4959 11.1332 15.8156 11.5117 15.9863C11.8879 16.1559 12.1765 16.1643 12.3935 16.0791C12.6107 15.9936 12.8179 15.7903 12.9775 15.4092C13.1379 15.