</svg></div></div><div class="IllustratedBackground-module-scss-module__HNnO0a__content"></div></div><div class="MediaStage-module-scss-module__xi5Kya__layout"><div class="MediaStage-module-scss-module__xi5Kya__cards" data-theme="dark"><div class="MediaStage-module-scss-module__xi5Kya__card"><p class="MediaStage-module-scss-module__xi5Kya__cardTitle">Build your request</p><p class="MediaStage-module-scss-module__xi5Kya__cardText">Classify all customer support tickets into the most relevant category.

Here is the list of categories to choose from:
{{CATEGORY_LIST}}

Here is the content of the support ticket:
{{TICKET_CONTENT}}</p></div></div><div class="MediaStage-module-scss-module__xi5Kya__mediaColumn"><div class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__panel theme-dark MediaStage-module-scss-module__xi5Kya__media"><div class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__sheet"><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p">You are an AI assistant specialized in classifying customer support tickets. Your task is to analyze the content of a given ticket and assign it to the most appropriate category from a predefined list. You will also provide reasoning for your classification decision.</p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p"> </p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p">First, let&#x27;s review the available categories:</p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p">&lt;category_list&gt;<br/>{{CATEGORY_LIST}}<br/>&lt;/category_list&gt;</p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p"> </p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p">Now, here is the content of the support ticket you need to classify:</p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p">&lt;ticket_content&gt;<br/>{{TICKET_CONTENT}}<br/>&lt;/ticket_content&gt;</p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p"> </p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p">Please follow these steps to complete the task:<br/>– Carefully read and analyze the ticket content.<br/>– Consider how the content relates to each of the available categories.<br/>– Choose the most appropriate category for the ticket.<br/>– Provide a detailed explanation of your reasoning process.</p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p"> </p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p">Use the following structure for your response:<br/>&lt;classification_analysis&gt;</p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p">In this section, break down your thought process:<br/>– Quote the most relevant parts of the ticket content.<br/>– List each category and note how it relates to the ticket content.<br/>– For each category, provide arguments for and against classifying the ticket into that category.<br/>– Rank the top 3 most likely categories.<br/>&lt;/classification_analysis&gt;</p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p">&lt;classification&gt;<br/>&lt;category&gt;Your chosen category goes here&lt;/category&gt;<br/>&lt;reasoning&gt;A concise summary of your reasoning for choosing this category&lt;/reasoning&gt;<br/>&lt;/classification&gt;</p><p class="DocumentPanel-module-scss-module__MuWjkG__p">Remember to be thorough in your analysis and clear in your explanation. Your goal is to provide an accurate classification with well-supported reasoning.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="featureList" data-section="featureList" data-cta-section="featureList" class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__wrapper theme-accent SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__spacingTopSmall"><div data-wf-threshold="large" data-wf-width="full" class="container"><div class="grid-12"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__inner FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__fullWidth"><div class="AnimatedReveal-module-scss-module__8zH9eW__container FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__list FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__horizontal FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__autofit FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__cols4" style="--reveal-y:20px;--reveal-duration:0.75s;--reveal-delay:0s;--reveal-stagger:0.1s"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:0"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16.5 15C16.7761 15 17 15.2239 17 15.5C17 15.7761 16.7761 16 16.5 16H3.5C3.22387 16 3.00002 15.7761 3 15.5C3 15.2239 3.22386 15 3.5 15H16.5ZM3.14648 3.14651C3.34175 2.95125 3.65825 2.95125 3.85352 3.14651L7.35352 6.64651C7.54846 6.8418 7.54867 7.15838 7.35352 7.35354L3.85352 10.8545C3.65838 11.0491 3.34162 11.0491 3.14648 10.8545C2.95139 10.6594 2.95173 10.3428 3.14648 10.1475L6.29297 7.00002L3.14648 3.85354C2.95123 3.65828 2.95124 3.34177 3.14648 3.14651ZM16.5 9.50002C16.7761 9.50002 17 9.72388 17 10C17 10.2761 16.7761 10.5 16.5 10.5H10.5C10.2239 10.5 10 10.2761 10 10C10 9.72388 10.2239 9.50002 10.5 9.50002H16.5ZM16.5 4.00002C16.7761 4.00002 17 4.22388 17 4.50002C17 4.77615 16.7761 5.00002 16.5 5.00002H10.5C10.2239 5.00002 10 4.77615 10 4.50002C10 4.22388 10.2239 4.00002 10.5 4.00002H16.5Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Build</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-3">Prototype prompts, upload skills and files, configure your agents.</p></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:1"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 2.5C5.93171 2.5 6.71235 3.13768 6.93457 4H13.75C15.5449 4 17 5.45507 17 7.25C17 9.04493 15.5449 10.5 13.75 10.5H12.707L10.3535 12.8535C10.1583 13.0488 9.84175 13.0488 9.64648 12.8535L7.29297 10.5H6.25C5.00736 10.5 4 11.5074 4 12.75C4 13.9926 5.00736 15 6.25 15H13.0654C13.2877 14.1377 14.0683 13.5 15 13.5C16.1046 13.5 17 14.3954 17 15.5C17 16.6046 16.1046 17