ve fair access, we may limit your usage in other ways, such as weekly and monthly caps or model and feature usage, at our discretion. When you reach a limit, you can wait for it to reset, move to a higher plan, or, on paid plans, turn on \u003cb\u003eusage credits\u003c/b\u003e to keep working at standard API rates. You can see where you stand anytime in \u003cc\u003eSettings \u003e Usage\u003c/c\u003e.3:[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{\"value\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"locale\":\"en\",\"messages\":{\"+335jbLLLD\":\"How to buy {name}\",\"+4BcOVAjaQ\":\"Media \u0026 entertainment\",\"+58+bO9Z7C\":\"Claude Design, Slides, and Docs\",\"+ECAI6c+vi\":\"See more\",\"+Hz2eiXVaS\":\"Additional hours\",\"+IWy/mZgxa\":\"Read 5 pricing pages\",\"+QVISEnK30\":\"Read 214 replies in [survey], Jul 27 – Aug 25\",\"+U6ozcnv4r\":\"Type\",\"+UZzShz4Ps\":\"Financial Services \u0026 Insurance\",\"+WOEzJDN46\":\"Enterprise search across your organization\",\"+ciZoNegZ/\":\"Product updates, how-tos, community spotlights, and more. Delivered monthly to your inbox.\",\"+fSZ8QbnO+\":\"Customer Support \u0026 Service Operations\",\"+ftV4Gx834\":\"Try Claude Code\",\"+hAhNwlMFe\":\"AI agents\",\"+iTX/h/IcT\":\"Custom instructions that Claude follows in conversations across your organization.\",\"+jQhEzhXMV\":\"Checking last quarter’s board deck for the list\",\"+mv46Ajpn5\":\"Per month\",\"+okyOR6KuS\":\"{count} {noun}\",\"+ol/wJP1Un\":\"Build the dashboard, one chart per metric\",\"+rPro49cx4\":\"Contact sales\",\"+uZMvaQTeS\":\"Watch on demand\",\"+vGpRUpAum\":\"Q2 just closed — that one, or the quarter in flight? And is this for their exec team or ours?\",\"+zr/j5UD2K\":\"Play video: {title}\",\"/+3CvzSbgL\":\"developer\",\"/3y8xiBnMd\":\"Other ways to use Claude Code:\",\"/5QNPTXJM2\":\"Haiku\",\"/6bs7dLvyv\":\"Cowork workflows\",\"/B1fSPGPXv\":\"$$0.05 per hour per container\",\"/CcNxkdSCC\":\"Telecom \u0026 Media\",\"/E8Jc3WmXR\":\"Roll the H2 budget with the new headcount plan.\",\"/I7VnbfmZB\":\"Get the technical rundown\",\"/P+ynz0465\":\"Canada\",\"/ReNZhv3e9\":\"The outcome\",\"/SFcM6xBuv\":\"Limit every week\",\"/VnDMl81rh\":\"Other\",\"/Y4IDvWCfi\":\"Cloud providers\",\"/ZQrtFKezs\":\"Up to $500 per month in pooled API credits\u003csup\u003e†\u003c/sup\u003e\",\"/aRLgsHgBe\":\"{minutes} min read\",\"/b4Xyd2QXq\":\"Scrollable table\",\"/dMnB9ZeuQ\":\"(open customer story panel)\",\"/eG4k8U8t9\":\"Claude Security\",\"/imGbbLfwh\":\"Health \u0026 life sciences\",\"/rPikmNUjz\":\"Pull customer feedback from Slack, email, and support from the last week. Group it into themes with counts, tie each to a roadmap item, and post the digest to my team channel.\",\"/rQjeE4JCG\":\"Access controls\",\"/xASRAjWhW\":\"For everyday work\",\"0+sV06e2uw\":\"Latin America\",\"03ENFEkqiU\":\"Large Enterprise (10,000+ employees)\",\"04W8kIpwVw\":\"Draft 738 comp letters\",\"06JffDWXSa\":\"Technology \u0026 "])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"Software\",\"08YrfCddTU\":\"Add in Claude\",\"08jKoUyLW0\":\"Get it on Google Play\",\"0FTRLd4IAK\":\"Claude Code is included in your Pro plan. Perfect for short coding sprints in small codebases.\",\"0Gck+wROXT\":\"Browse resources by section\",\"0I0+WaSyge\":\"HIPAA-ready offering\",\"0LPi+J5UQ7\":\"$$200/month\",\"0My0MM6yYM\":\"Upcoming webinar\",\"0OwrsECu+y\":\"Guides\",\"0Rm7kOJxZR\":\"Question what’s next\",\"0UHDGWSXx0\":\"Three passes: visit, cite the playbook, then rank\",\"0XPZhVZucD\":\"Migrate accounts using your domains\",\"0ZFn3yOqhr\":\"Remember context from past conversations.\",\"0h9Fh2DHim\":\"Month-end close\",\"0iFhHTKqOC\":\"Yes, annual plans are designed to cost less than monthly subscriptions. Annual subscriptions are available for Pro and Team plans. Enterprise plans are only available as annual subscriptions.\",\"0jJMjm+jPA\":\"Or read the \u003ca\u003edocumentation\u003c/a\u003e\",\"0k8wNi7/xe\":\"ACH\",\"0nyXXprYM2\":\"Two exports, two different shapes — mapping them first\",\"0oL1zz+YDx\":\"Copied!\",\"0orj2Jwwz1\":\"Search your company's internal docs and data, not just the web. Currently available in Team and Enterprise plans.\",\"0rxZmU7myQ\":\"carousel\",\"0sX7ofcu05\":\"Cybersecurity \u0026 Threat Detection\",\"0wJ7N+noSq\":\"Task\",\"1/McL9n3MC\":\"Run 751 eligible staff against the 3.0% pool\",\"10eFonbhxJ\":\"Remote — same timezone\",\"11vfLd7vbP\":\"Reading the cases before citing them, not the other way round\",\"136Gy/iBzN\":\"Join the marketplace\",\"15mdu2Q0Wz\":\"{name} connector for Claude\",\"19jg7N7dJK\":\"Sonnet\",\"1BUbFCGMFH\":\"{minutes} min watch\",\"1OwWKCxoeC\":\"Add the interview kit\",\"1Wedr65Y7U\":\"United States\",\"1XvgYxOFV4\":\"Claude in Chrome\",\"1YWZP92368\":\"✶ Welcome to Claude Code\",\"1ZgrhWrHJx\":\"Role\",\"1ZksZc5lya\":\"Parallel tasks\",\"1bkMcEvH9s\":\"Preferred partners\",\"1mQxvbzyMt\":\"Upcoming | {date}\",\"1rCkgVkEBU\":\"Managing your plan\",\"1rMFg0JQMQ\":\"Audit logs\",\"1tmGLe3H36\":\"Read the week’s call transcripts and notes\",\"1tvGh9TMZE\":\"Customer-Facing AI Product Build\",\"1wokJ79qDV\":\"Download on the App Store\",\"1yI27UHVWQ\":\"Get the developer newsletter\",\"25oM9QYcXw\":\"Sort\",\"26YuH36sfx\":\"Day-in-the-life artifacts — drag, or use arrow keys, to flip\",\"28nBaTB1uA\":\"$$100 a month in API credits to build on the Claude Platform\u003csup\u003e†\u003c/sup\u003e\",\"2C6TrW95uE\":\"Annual\",\"2KCXPdJ/UG\":\"products\",\"2Sfvjsgf6v\":\"SMB (100–500 employees)\",\"2UZQbZDy1s\":\"What kind of tasks can Claude Code handle?\",\"2WJFp1YqEN\":\"Start in your terminal\",\"2WQeDAIFPv\":\"Connect your apps and tools\",\"2b6AZVea7M\":\"Anton Biryukov, Staff Software Engineer\",\"2bAgDxW/tn\":\"Next testimonial\",\"2mMJRvsAg1\":\"Connectors\",\"2praATqqMQ\":\"Popular {category} connectors\",\"2vmRD40EeI\":\"Newest\",\"2vwnvdoWr1\":\"The result\",\"34Up+lB19+\":\"View more\",\"34yPMSzWyG\":\"Lay out 19 questions across five topics\",\"3Ch0fIqz9u\":\"connector URL\",\"3D8vXwABOK\":\"Use a Claude account, or your own cloud provider: Access Claude through Amazon Bedrock, Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform, or Microsoft Foundry.\",\"3I6tohOmT8\":\"Thank you! You're subscribed.\",\"3ITcp90VKQ\":\"Legacy models\",\"3KNMbJGqwU\":\"Articles\",\"3P/NtfQdI8\":\"Competitor pricing\",\"3VBX5gqSmc\":\"Hand Claude a bug fix, test, or multi-day migration. Steer and review from your terminal, IDE, Slack, or web.\",\"3YoQ6JCPoQ\":\"Featured customer stories\",\"3efkxwPxx0\":\"US$20/seat/month, billed annually, 20 seat minimum. Usage cost scales with model and task.\",\"3gItYjkZGG\":\"Managed Agents\",\"3sTnTFu6ns\":\"You can access Claude Code with a Claude Pro, Max, or Ultra plan, a Team or Enterprise plan, or a Claude Console account. Download Claude Code and sign in with your respective Claude or Console credentials.\",\"3tAkTpkbHs\":\"Sales-assisted Enterprise: Reach out to your Anthropic Contact or our Sales team to discuss cancellation.\",\"3wNgxTDHQY\":\"Trials\",\"3yi1y+WfGF\":\"Read 183 mentions in #brand-mentions\",\"41boi+xD0y\":\"Transform how your organization operates with Claude\",\"48C32imGzN\":\"Pull the cases, verify all three citations\",\"4BQ05o/CKM\":\"Close expanded resources canvas\",\"4G377VcI73\":\"Greater China\",\"4IE7QkYChg\":\"Work where you want\",\"4IlrtO7A9k\":\"Scan with your phone to get the Claude app\",\"4JvX9ZTEQB\":\"Context window\",\"4UJzGy5MdX\":\"Ask questions abo"])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"ut this page\",\"4VKWe7lzZ/\":\"{tagline} | Powered by Claude\",\"4XfMuxy3FO\":\"Videos\",\"4YJHutR26p\":\"Clear search\",\"4Zuvkw479e\":\"Get access\",\"4a37nY0VXy\":\"Public Sector / Government\",\"4cDn6bn0Tv\":\"Productivity\",\"4i2o/EIT3c\":\"plugins\",\"4lOuLo24hP\":\"Early access to advanced Claude features\",\"4s6A+mzBpF\":\"Thank you for registering\",\"4xQceCdGDV\":\"Build, install, or share reusable instructions that teach Claude how to handle specific tasks.\",\"5+PVplP8VZ\":\"/ MTok\",\"52vi5CE5vA\":\"Connect the apps you already use, including interactive MCP apps.\",\"5778UDXWht\":\"Merit analysis\",\"5AYFxaaHjc\":\"Webinar\",\"5IQxU3z0ch\":\"Dedicated API credits and educational features for student learning\",\"5IelMfRgHv\":\"Claude Dashboards (beta)\",\"5K7lTis/nz\":\"Use-Case Portfolio \u0026 Business Case\",\"5Kp2KmGChl\":\"\u003cb\u003e5x Pro usage\u003c/b\u003e every 5 hours and every week*\",\"5MDGuMLnEB\":\"Enter your email\",\"5WwopwNIIR\":\"Pricing\",\"5WxElAnA3f\":\"For individual plans, go to \u003ca\u003eSettings \u003e Billing\u003c/a\u003e and choose Manage subscription.\",\"5Xfy+G4sVZ\":\"Search stories\",\"5a1X5/f0GE\":\"Team \u0026 Enterprise\",\"5b37D8X7xu\":\"Add {title} in Claude (opens in new tab)\",\"5bUGZrLF/+\":\"Working out which increases sit above guideline\",\"5hq8dMAHpG\":\"Previous testimonials\",\"5y6Z0osd/w\":\"Deciding which moves clear the 10% bar\",\"5yUsUeGLGI\":\"Replay\",\"5yduo5c/tj\":\"varies by model\",\"6/LbciL4Au\":\"Webinar series\",\"60iFHYCiow\":\"Try it in Claude\",\"62oul2piSq\":\"Installs\",\"68l1rBm0Gz\":\"Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"68nUcEsXOA\":\"Reading the draft against the guide, clause by clause\",\"698p8qFdYq\":\"The solution\",\"6GQHuulHQO\":\"Read my last week of call transcripts and notes, then update the matching Salesforce opportunities: next steps, notes, methodology, and competition. Show me the changes before saving.\",\"6M4sLy7kaz\":\"You set the direction as the architect and orchestrator, and Claude Code does the work. Describe what you want and it plans, writes code, runs tests, and opens pull requests. It can work on several tasks at once, and surface decisions you need to make for it to keep going.\",\"6Ms/+StOD/\":\"Other products\",\"6Qf4xFVi6g\":\"Interactive demo — open this page on a larger screen to try it\",\"6XEUmrkM3g\":\"Usecase\",\"6YDpd8yQHH\":\"({count})\",\"6nB4tMLtqX\":\"Work with Claude directly in Slack. Tag Claude and it gets things done. In beta for Team and Enterprise plans.\",\"6o8KJWoBpP\":\"Ongoing Cowork / Claude Code Scaled User Support\",\"6puvqzJx6N\":\"Payments are generally non-refundable, except where our \u003ca\u003eConsumer Terms of Service\u003c/a\u003e say otherwise or where local law requires it.\",\"70Gt6S6RTw\":\"Copy command to clipboard\",\"72647oNnNq\":\"Live and recorded sessions with Anthropic and customer teams — demos, deep dives, Q\u0026A, and practical takeaways.\",\"775tfsmBuP\":\"Jump to section\",\"78vrMqo83J\":\"Close filters\",\"79lKyOa3xd\":\"Search results\",\"7ACyB5Behv\":\"Anthropic verified\",\"7GnV3M0ilx\":\"Code onboarding\",\"7NrmWSpPNp\":\"Everything in {previousPlan}, plus:\",\"7Rm1x6G5+3\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"7bRvabf8yd\":\"Budget reforecast\",\"7eywRBsmjb\":\"Open Brand-guidelines.pdf\",\"7fCBPXAUhO\":\"See all connectors\",\"7oFrM64tU+\":\"Legal\",\"7s+LPiO9Q7\":\"Trending connectors\",\"7xSFBZhAfR\":\"User and organizational level spend controls\",\"7xvMxtmR41\":\"Infringement triage\",\"7ysUR8GTc7\":\"What Claude Code can take on\",\"7zkx4+3vi0\":\"On-site\",\"7zyAzJqQJJ\":\"Sorry, there was a problem with your submission. Please try again later.\",\"8+4ibzS8mU\":\"Read more — opens the {title} use case\",\"8/vYGQB37K\":\"Chat on web, iOS, Android and Desktop\",\"82yGCIJNwC\":\"Prompts ≤ {threshold} tokens\",\"86LL6e7yZI\":\"DACH (Germany, Austria, Switzerland)\",\"8COJ198mdB\":\"{n}. {label}\",\"8FpI47yX0n\":\"Search connectors\",\"8Jli4bBhDe\":\"Call prep from nothing\",\"8Q+Q5LuGum\":\"Browse connectors\",\"8VBXf0QeIU\":\"Claude by Anthropic | The AI for problem solvers\",\"8ZZduOA+Di\":\"Single sign-on (SSO) and domain capture\",\"8ZmQs1Ya83\":\"After each of my meetings this week, read the transcript and pull out action items and owners. Post a running list to my team channel and remind owners two days before the next meeting if their item’s still open.\",\"8pKEsMFRZX\":\"Mo"])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"ving from monthly to annual works the same way, with your remaining time credited to the first annual invoice.\",\"8quEg9mkqD\":\"results\",\"8qwcfYeMIT\":\"QBR from a vague ask\",\"8tkn+vCQ3U\":\"Services Offered\",\"8wANzh1GRf\":\"The conversation\",\"9+DdtuCqLw\":\"Next\",\"94qBVbLNk3\":\"Register for the live sessions with Anthropic and partner teams — bring your questions and get answers in real time.\",\"9Fb/Iespb6\":\"Connected for this step: {tools}.\",\"9Obw6CDkje\":\"Filter\",\"9QGphhmfD2\":\"Can I pay annually? Does it cost less than if I pay monthly?\",\"9RgjIYOB1Q\":\"Batch prices shown: {percent}% off\",\"9ScFr4b71+\":\"Or visit {url} on your phone\",\"9UgOT8oCdQ\":\"Only use connectors from developers you trust. Anthropic does not control which tools developers make available and cannot verify that they will work as intended or that they won’t change.\",\"9XGMrOTnKT\":\"How much does it cost to use?\",\"9b+sXfI92T\":\"You’re all set.\",\"9eu7ecJNUx\":\"That one. Enough that I don’t look unprepared.\",\"9fPXDyKyP8\":\"When you choose to pay annually, you're billed once up front for the year. If you're already on a monthly plan, you can switch to annual in \u003ca\u003eSettings \u003e Billing\u003c/a\u003e, and any unused time is credited toward your first annual invoice. See the steps for \u003cb\u003ePro\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cc\u003eTeam\u003c/c\u003e.\",\"9iJnnOdMff\":\"Yes, Claude Enterprise and Claude API pricing can be customized for your organization with volume and committed-spend discounts through our sales team. We don't publish discount rates, so figures you see elsewhere may not reflect our pricing. \u003ca\u003eContact sales\u003c/a\u003e to learn more.\",\"9tYYejTpLE\":\"Read 612 responses and 384 comments\",\"9vy2pEOvDq\":\"Read the full story\",\"A/LzeErMxB\":\"Micro SMB (\u003c100 employees)\",\"A1EbEY+Q0P\":\"Run the merit analysis on this comp data against the budget, then generate a comp letter for each employee from the template.\",\"A5vVzYSCmo\":\"Location:\",\"A61C8w9a82\":\"What should I use Claude for?\",\"A6qyZe1BYT\":\"Add the tools legal teams use every day.\",\"A88HrTWxUA\":\"Build the comps table against five peers\",\"AC/GO80QwS\":\"Prevent new organizations from being created with any of your verified domains\",\"AFiVmp/jhu\":\"Kick off coding tasks in Slack\",\"AH7lg7TO1C\":\"Sustained Adoption / CoE Program\",\"AHFXfe4eaV\":\"{name} use cases — showing {task}, {n} of {count}. Drag, or use arrow keys, to sort through them. Press Enter to open the front one.\",\"AJKqfJbbfY\":\"Customer testimonial\",\"AKpqmfKlbs\":\"Claude Code can handle routine work like bug fixes and testing, and larger jobs like refactors and new features that are long-running and asynchronous. You set the direction as the architect and orchestrator, and Claude Code does the work. Describe what you want and it plans, writes code, runs tests, and opens pull requests. It can work on several tasks at once, and surface decisions you need to make for it to keep going.\",\"AM0c9squGx\":\"Prompt caching pricing reflects 5-minute TTL. Learn about \u003ca\u003eextended prompt caching\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"AesVpL7rYY\":\"Upgrades take effect right away, and any unused time on your current plan is credited toward the new one, so you won't pay twice for the same days.\",\"AkXGCFumOh\":\"Claude Cowork\",\"AkmQfB0Rzu\":\"Connect Claude to {name}.\",\"At3gT+O+My\":\"MCP servers\",\"Auznb9aRrh\":\"Fergal Reid, VP of AI\",\"Ax/KSPqGLa\":\"Related stories\",\"AxMhQrcUDC\":\"High\",\"B1kbGgSfbf\":\"Download for Windows\",\"B26fpF2/J4\":\"Alphabetically (A to Z)\",\"B2Vf6ixoR1\":\"Claude for Microsoft Outlook\",\"B5kyn8wDq3\":\"connectors\",\"B6CB3748fZ\":\"Web\",\"B9yoMuX1fR\":\"Everyone you sell against, or the five in the board deck? And should I compare list price or the tier people actually buy?\",\"BAncQRgjIh\":\"Yes. Pro, Max, Ultra, Team, and Enterprise users can access Claude Code on the Claude desktop app.\",\"BB6lTqQOLY\":\"Explore plans\",\"BCC9md5xIE\":\"Agents and products\",\"BGLX5NdOb5\":\"CRM hygiene\",\"BNvjfIjIf0\":\"{time} {who} — {headline}. {body}\",\"BXD3KAKtuc\":\"Service Delivery Location\",\"BfTwcVPBt3\":\"Read the Q3 transcript and the 10-Q\",\"BhA83sdjh4\":\"User preferences\",\"BhcFUIL5/4\":\"Desktop extension\",\"Bil1ISGOy5\":\"Your terminal is where real work happens. Claude Code connects with the tools that"])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1," power development—deployment, databases, monitoring, version control. Rather than adding another interface to juggle, it enhances your existing stack.\",\"BjCtRR/GIo\":\"Working out which Meridian on today’s calendar, and who’s on the invite\",\"BvE1nOsq7b\":\"Search resources\",\"BwZb5mni5x\":\"Get Claude Code\",\"C8AzZ0X7oP\":\"v2 differs from v1 in nine places — six of them substantive\",\"CDLJ0Wjq0x\":\"Enterprise\",\"CFPRDLdYTB\":\"Create plan\",\"CMZhH+Z/OI\":\"Try another search or clear some of your filters.\",\"CNGa9IXcLs\":\"Reading the channel, the tracker and the merge log\",\"CNXQN5zp9z\":\"Copy code\",\"CQJzKN8cVI\":\"Claude Code works on macOS, Linux, and Windows. See full system requirements.\",\"CTVIX7Z4at\":\"Rollout \u0026 Activation\",\"CV2vjsP6Ub\":\"Connector URL\",\"CX3hS80UYu\":\"Team roll-up in Slack\",\"CXWwyoYbGQ\":\"Register for the webinar\",\"CYuo+wX6eG\":\"No 5-hour limit for \u003ca\u003everified accounts\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"CnPG8j3li8\":\"Featured\",\"CoWpJWiYVJ\":\"Instructions for Claude\",\"CwV6D1FhOX\":\"No 5-hour limit\",\"CxfMfc15sL\":\"Chronology first — the questions fall out of the timeline\",\"D+6h6TIo00\":\"{count, plural, one {# row} other {# rows}} found\",\"D/lvDONQRr\":\"None by default\",\"D1bNY2XSH+\":\"Invoicing / net terms\",\"D1x6rMxD4s\":\"Live and on-demand sessions with Anthropic experts and the teams building with Claude in production.\",\"D4tTLS0+hZ\":\"Academic research and learning mode\",\"D7/f22bGHj\":\"Monthly and annual\",\"D7vmeSqorj\":\"Memory across conversations\",\"DH9P+z7MtU\":\"Made by\",\"DIpquX3s9Z\":\"Desktop, web, mobile\",\"DStPgv0gVx\":\"Purchase credits to keep working after you hit a limit. Billed at standard API rates.\",\"DUTDaVDUur\":\"@Claude can you roll up what this team actually shipped last week? Staff meeting is at 10.\",\"DfAnn9VZIX\":\"HIPAA-ready offering available\",\"Dn9LjlBFZX\":\"Prompt caching\",\"Do1PfdGC4N\":\"Chapters\",\"DsxJdt1bvW\":\"Models and usage\",\"Dw21EKvLQv\":\"Showing all {total} {noun}\",\"DwGAvV9dEN\":\"Pull views and signups\",\"Dyefg67c79\":\"Re-phase H2, flag every cell I touched\",\"E6PrTws2vF\":\"Enterprise setup guide\",\"E7a7NYp+eH\":\"Per seat / month if billed annually. \u003cpremium\u003e$125\u003c/premium\u003e if billed monthly.\",\"EFgTTiTQiG\":\"View rate card for {date} (opens in new tab)\",\"EIGaZ8KjC+\":\"Manufacturing \u0026 Industrial\",\"EJSVsOA19u\":\"Skills\",\"ENo6UqZ37g\":\"More tabs\",\"ETZQvop16J\":\"Search {text}\",\"ETbLUgrIVW\":\"Monday readout\",\"EWw/tKINJT\":\"Apply\",\"EcEUzn5FnA\":\"France \u0026 Benelux\",\"EhCPv5SS0w\":\"Video thumbnail\",\"Eig3D3YI14\":\"Use Cases\",\"Elvb3bbMMH\":\"Give Claude access to the latest information from the web. Doesn’t include input and output tokens required to process requests.\",\"EqWQaLazVZ\":\"\u003cb\u003eProjects:\u003c/b\u003e Group related coding sessions so you can run and easily supervise multiple Claude agents at once. Available on Claude Code Desktop.\",\"F/dsecntWx\":\"{total, plural, one {Showing # resource} other {Showing all # resources}}\",\"F1hhgVAP7J\":\"Show all {total}\",\"F6oVpjZztW\":\"High-performance model for coding and agents\",\"FF8JcX97n6\":\"$$17\",\"FHR/PAPynl\":\"Fill out the form below to reserve your seat.\",\"FIgxpdtq+B\":\"Stop bouncing between tools. Claude Code works with GitHub, GitLab, and your command line tools to read issues, write code, run tests, and open pull requests.\",\"FJ6r9Eufij\":\"Continue with Google\",\"FJEYiOibdH\":\"Explore here\",\"FSjd9rZo1K\":\"Multiple dates\",\"Fb1mzpiO08\":\"Search\",\"FfTQU3GXUT\":\"{count, plural, one {Use case} other {Use cases}}\",\"FfxQi1pUmG\":\"$$10 / 1K searches\",\"Fg6Vy9QMJG\":\"$$0\",\"Fhu3ABLI4q\":\"Latest\",\"FkM6Qwkx30\":\"Upcoming webinars\",\"FvDdZkxQir\":\"ANZ\",\"Fwr3KRT730\":\"Pull DAU/WAU, retention and funnel, Aug 24–30\",\"G05yMjx1vw\":\"Related webinars\",\"G3+U+7J07W\":\"Claude lives inside the Microsoft 365 apps you already use.\",\"G8w3EJKHuZ\":\"Content type\",\"GOvFLa40S0\":\"Read 128 messages in #feedback, Aug 24–30\",\"GQ0YrpkAdr\":\"Showing {shown} of {total} {noun}\",\"GWmYL7NpXj\":\"\u003cb\u003eNo 5-hour limit\u003c/b\u003e\",\"GWoVQxhRVj\":\"Common workflows\",\"GcAIteLmkD\":\"On-demand webinar\",\"GjrgLY/waX\":\"Onboarding\",\"GmIaog+I5f\":\"{name} screenshots\",\"GzQKSwjuOs\":\"Product\",\"GzbjoqmZJB\":\"Show translation\",\"H0+S5T7dUn\":\"Chat on web, desktop, and mobile\",\"H5JZcZW8Cd\":\"Inference hooks\",\"H7Zv5xsTj+\":\"Claude"])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1," Code\",\"HDm/2g1/7+\":\"Pull seat and usage exports\",\"HF143K5NAr\":\"Claude is an artificial intelligence, trained by Anthropic using Constitutional AI to be safe, accurate, and secure — the trusted assistant for you to do your best work.\",\"HF2OkF1DIr\":\"Claude Tag\",\"HHk1YvjFgM\":\" — {desc}\",\"HKWhXVGKTa\":\"Code the comments, build five slides\",\"HLprRIKoo6\":\"Open table of contents\",\"HMbjivrCNV\":\"Is Claude Code secure?\",\"HVmghIbol8\":\"No matches for “{query}” across articles, guides, webinars, or videos.\",\"HYZYuz8M1D\":\"10x\",\"HZkULQX8Xg\":\"Filter resources\",\"HcNbfLGpGx\":\"Even more Claude Code included in your Ultra plan. Great value for power users with the most access to Claude models. Includes $200 per month in API credits.\",\"Hgkut0mMoE\":\"Filter and sort\",\"HjW2V3iNFV\":\"Start a session from anywhere\",\"HkWKsNSS00\":\"No results for those filters\",\"HlVJrx+gDS\":\"Claude Motion and Dashboards (beta)\",\"Hnnn0PnY5R\":\"See and use your screen (beta).\",\"HqRNN8pEq/\":\"Support\",\"Hz0MU11EF7\":\"Enterprise (self-serve)\",\"HzfrYuQNz6\":\"Grid\",\"I/2HFW+D6s\":\"Replay the demo\",\"I2+X/LfbWN\":\"Available on Team and Enterprise\",\"I4GjoK4795\":\"Get it done\",\"I5NMJ8llIi\":\"More\",\"I9iTYkENkV\":\"A–Z\",\"IBt78eM62t\":\"All Claude features, plus more usage than Pro*\",\"IEOD7p5H0d\":\"India\",\"IJPRksP9/W\":\"Add to Slack\",\"ILHmstkrAT\":\"Learn more about {label}\",\"ILqGaCj3vq\":\"What do I get with Claude Pro?\",\"INF+EUAURg\":\"Industry:\",\"INywx6ejWe\":\"The \u003ca\u003eClaude Enterprise plan\u003c/a\u003e is built for large businesses operating at scale. Pricing is $20 per seat per month plus usage billed at API rates, so cost scales with the models and tasks your team runs. Enterprise is billed annually and includes everything in Team plus advanced security and admin controls, including SCIM, audit logs, custom data retention, and role-based access. You can get started self-serve or \u003cb\u003econtact sales\u003c/b\u003e for a tailored quote.\",\"IRk+ZPx2OV\":\"By type\",\"IRwxwerSnK\":\"Use-case library\",\"ISPph/9Siw\":\"Show all {heading}\",\"IU4hizU80W\":\"Everything in Team, plus Claude Security, usage and ROI analytics, role-based access, spend limits, and custom data controls. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e\",\"IU5RX/Z3zA\":\"Retail \u0026 Consumer Goods\",\"IVHFgsQmRj\":\"Connector category:\",\"IgB6GUj3uH\":\"Individual\",\"ImN1cEkQnv\":\"{time} · {who}\",\"InWqysQtIQ\":\"Optional\",\"Io5uVH8RZk\":\"Top plugins\",\"IqA+c0CImc\":\"Project sharing and collaboration\",\"IwdwBLWhqw\":\"Currently available in Enterprise plans.\",\"IzZt81qaKP\":\"Service tiers\",\"J9TGBV98HZ\":\"On the web\",\"JEe7dVso7F\":\"Research\",\"JG0CAlpn7j\":\"Play video\",\"JGzkloY4Ai\":\"Log in, open Get help from the menu, start a message, and choose Claude Refund Request to check your eligibility.\",\"JIwaAyJRrM\":\"5x\",\"JJ35/Srr3Q\":\"No stories for those filters\",\"JJNc3cbYIJ\":\"Previous\",\"JQrdnny+Nq\":\"These sessions run on a regular schedule — register and pick the date that works for you.\",\"JUjwnv3mwJ\":\"{name} plugin\",\"JWmizX/FBI\":\"What is fast mode on Claude Code?\",\"JXueRWK2rt\":\"Comprehensive access for all university members at discounted rates\",\"JYheeKlclA\":\"Enterprise (2,500–10,000 employees)\",\"JfQS9tJsdM\":\"Connect to my analytics data and build a product metrics dashboard: DAU/WAU, weekly retention, funnel conversion, and feature adoption. Explain any trends I should pay attention to this week.\",\"JihwxwseKK\":\"Copy {what}: {value}\",\"JoFFlh/6P/\":\"Creative\",\"JuFwafGZVQ\":\"See what Claude can do\",\"K4LPshHQPu\":\"Southeast Asia\",\"KAMbvwuIZX\":\"Interactive demo\",\"KD0yK9ykwB\":\"Search the web for current information.\",\"KDp8HrAmpK\":\"Currently available in Team and Enterprise plans.\",\"KEc6pNHE0k\":\"On demand\",\"KJiJ16Wvln\":\"Read 46 support threads and survey replies\",\"KL2MxiTKbw\":\"If you subscribed through the App Store, \u003ca\u003eApple\u003c/a\u003e handles the refund, so you'll request it from Apple.\",\"KQsZBWlEw/\":\"Related\",\"KV39e0OucO\":\"Batch processing\",\"KWT64rcIau\":\"Service partners\",\"KirsaaebkW\":\"Claude Code builds the plan, asks clarifying questions, and handles work that runs for hours or days.\",\"KiybH01+vc\":\"Reading the closed quarter, not the live one\",\"Kn7vU7eKik\":\"Connector category\",\"KorkNqY43b\":\"Fix software bugs faster with Claude\""])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,",\"KpM1pG1PZT\":\"\u003ca\u003eClaude Code\u003c/a\u003e is included in all paid plans. It shares the same usage limits as the rest of your plan, so your work in the terminal and your chats draw from one pool. For heavy coding sessions, you can also switch to pay-as-you-go API credits through a \u003cb\u003eConsole account\u003c/b\u003e.\",\"KqddAmXqyb\":\"Audience intelligence\",\"KsA5dxbgQZ\":\"Ask Claude\",\"Kxe4ncgJSl\":\"AWS Marketplace availability\",\"KyZTTz/7n6\":\"Install Android app\",\"KzhATej1wl\":\"Add the tools creative teams use every day.\",\"L87tUW3bhy\":\"Now standing: Mondays before stand-up\",\"LAfzAtBpQi\":\"Use case\",\"LCmXO6QlCo\":\"$$100\",\"LNSYKrS/5V\":\"Pull the account history and open deals\",\"LOenikqeTT\":\"Deposition prep\",\"LT0KuSwXbf\":\"Connectors for {category}\",\"LZmbJq3fPy\":\"For teams of 2 to 150\",\"LjnLOcxD+v\":\"Energy \u0026 Utilities\",\"Lmnlt2tz4R\":\"Explore detailed pricing\",\"Lnreb5NhFR\":\"Close table of contents\",\"LteDgy93R9\":\"What are the system requirements to run Claude Code?\",\"LvCm24GPqE\":\"Loading results\",\"Lvx+XJLaHk\":\"Use Claude on the web, on desktop, or on your phone.\",\"LwQkfjULGK\":\"\u003ca\u003eUsage limits\u003c/a\u003e apply. Prices shown don’t include applicable tax. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"LyBDJh42zM\":\"Industry Expertise\",\"M/jXg8HTrY\":\"Claude Fable models are included on Max and Ultra plans at 50% of your weekly usage limit. Pro users can access Fable via usage credits. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e\",\"MIFKBiOhbV\":\"Remote Service Coverage\",\"MJCvguDp2J\":\"{index} of {count}\",\"MJDJEKDT6z\":\"Copy as markdown\",\"MQJoVDaC+o\":\"Title\",\"MToUjWCyCj\":\"Partner\",\"MaILmHPsbC\":\"Fast mode is a high-speed configuration for Opus 5.5, delivering lower-latency responses at a higher cost per token. Fast mode is available:\",\"McpdtM/Iqk\":\"Ask something quick, or hand off a long, complex task that keeps working after you close your laptop.\",\"Mq1jIo+1Vd\":\"Feedback digest\",\"MqDIuf9t4w\":\"Get editable, polished files, ready for your review.\",\"Mus1yQ/r0t\":\"Legal research drafting\",\"Mzoxu3fG0M\":\"How do I upgrade, downgrade, or switch between plans?\",\"N7+y5HbtWx\":\"Category\",\"N9ZQznjAPq\":\"Does Claude offer refunds?\",\"ND3DzPJ5JP\":\"No model training on your content by default\",\"NFxTIW5JKw\":\"Run multi-hour refactors and migrations\",\"NOqPpL4P+e\":\"Go to slide {number}\",\"NPIxkXaDeC\":\"Content Creation \u0026 Copywriting\",\"NPn1/DOEtT\":\"\u003ca\u003eUsage limits\u003c/a\u003e apply. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"NVztUwoQRF\":\"Side notes\",\"NXq6qVdgkC\":\"Fastest, most cost-efficient model\",\"NeCVswURBl\":\"{count, plural, one {# resource} other {# resources}}\",\"Nq4dyw1Bmh\":\"Reading time\",\"NuuQZIlKVX\":\"Public Sector\",\"Nwx77cdkLK\":\"{shown} of {total, plural, one {# row} other {# rows}} shown\",\"NzdcBOd456\":\"Claude Use Cases\",\"NzthwuFDHM\":\"Keep working after your included limits run out, billed at standard API rates.\",\"O+QGhrX2LT\":\"or\",\"O0tRsUvDJG\":\"With Claude, we're not just automating customer service—we're elevating it to truly human quality. This lets support teams think more strategically about customer experience and what makes interactions genuinely valuable.\",\"O5eI3Jn4W4\":\"How much does the Claude Enterprise plan cost?\",\"O630vKbnxm\":\"No matching resources\",\"O7w4wx4rVp\":\"Metrics dashboard\",\"OALcOgG1oH\":\"AI Readiness \u0026 Governance Assessment / Design\",\"OBvhgmAH/f\":\"Engagement Type\",\"OEGZQCZfNy\":\"{current} / {total}\",\"OIpKQnZfnN\":\"Claude has six pricing plans available — Free, Pro, Max, Ultra, Team, and Enterprise. The Free plan offers limited use with no payment required. \u003ca\u003eLearn more about available pricing plans\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"OKhRC6eWRw\":\"Share\",\"OLZ/2Lw4KR\":\"What are the usage limits on each plan, and what happens when I hit them?\",\"OUeTErUKof\":\"Fast mode is a high-speed configuration for Opus 5.5, delivering lower-latency responses at a higher cost per token. Fast mode is available: In research preview on Claude Code, and is priced at $8/$40 per million tokens. On consumption-based plans. Via usage credits for users on subscription plans.\",\"ObBcvFtyWs\":\"How {name} uses Claude\",\"OmsvLbYdpQ\":\"Download now\",\"OnF9aqAuar\":\"Voice mode\",\"OnuJGKM1rH\":\"Claude works in your apps — includin"])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"g interactive MCP plugins.\",\"Or0b5msIzp\":\"Search plugins\",\"OwWTjF9M1j\":\"Featured resources\",\"P0TE2ALDmY\":\"Claude Motion (beta)\",\"P1tvAIm1Ml\":\"explore agents and products\",\"P3xTo7q4f7\":\"Unsubscribe at any time.\",\"P4UyUvnb7B\":\"Global Premier partners\",\"P6GgnebqRh\":\"Priority access at high traffic times\",\"PECEUoxZKu\":\"Customer Size Served\",\"PHK8oGCXpr\":\"Pricing for Claude Platform features\",\"PLaIvPt/de\":\"Claude Design, Slides, Docs\",\"PSmrK+mDP2\":\"Read every reply in my Gmail label [survey] and the #brand-mentions Slack channel from the last 30 days. Group the feedback into themes, count how often each comes up, and tell me what to prioritize.\",\"PYNCKew1ZV\":\"Checking this week against last before charting\",\"PcrBx00bVu\":\" (opens in new tab)\",\"Pd1vUnepSm\":\"Continue a session from your computer\",\"Ph2fMyDfXE\":\"Commerce \u0026 shopping\",\"PiBJyYwO3U\":\"Data \u0026 analytics\",\"Ppx673YPhq\":\"Reports\",\"PqgUA2Ubee\":\"Claude Tag is currently available in Team and Enterprise plans.\",\"PvhTq9ccL5\":\"Copy: {text}\",\"PxB7ivU2on\":\"Jump to\",\"Q2qBgHIXOy\":\"All capabilities\",\"QApUINIDYB\":\"Meets you where you code\",\"QJAllUAc2k\":\"Plugins\",\"QLKZDX+3PE\":\"JD check\",\"QNTLn3jFgm\":\"code modernization\",\"QReeDrrQbw\":\"AI Strategy \u0026 Roadmap\",\"QUO3/+K8+z\":\"{label} | {readTime}\",\"QhowibB8wT\":\"United Kingdom \u0026 Ireland\",\"QnwMokY5S7\":\"browse connectors and plugins\",\"QrH/QosLcB\":\"News, announcements, and stories from Anthropic about Claude and the people building with it.\",\"Qv1dgX29u9\":\"Cover\",\"QzUbL8TCCW\":\"You can cancel anytime, and your plan stays active until the end of your current billing period. To avoid the next charge, cancel at least 24 hours before your renewal date.\",\"R/eOkjWqNU\":\"Pro\",\"R3DO8NohKA\":\"Claude Code and Claude Cowork\",\"R5NhY/xR8g\":\"Claude is designed to work in the folders and tools you allow, and by default asks before permanently deleting files.\",\"R62WoCJW9z\":\"How are Max and Ultra different from Pro?\",\"R8+YmE68fr\":\"Usage analytics\",\"RBKgNODPrT\":\"Make it yours\",\"RF4DloWyGj\":\"Sorting replies from chatter before counting anything\",\"RIXvfyYOXw\":\"Pilot / POC\",\"RIhUQZiswe\":\"In some upgrades (for example Pro Annual to Max Monthly), your remaining value on your old plan is larger than the cost of one billing period of the new plan. In this case, the excess will be stored as credit, which will automatically get used for future purchases.\",\"RIt3NiK5Mx\":\"Claude Science\",\"RLGhpe7ddV\":\"View rate card\",\"RMOn5LTG7Q\":\"Claude Code runs in your terminal and works alongside your preferred IDE and development tools without requiring you to change your workflow. Claude Code can also use command line tools (like Git) and MCP servers (like GitHub) to extend its own capabilities using your tools.\",\"ROBSvgY5lo\":\"When used with a Claude Console account, Claude Code consumes API tokens at \u003ca\u003estandard API pricing\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"RQN8BHDsni\":\"Pull ad, email and social against Aug 10–16\",\"RRp63dkeIU\":\"What is Claude and how does it work?\",\"RWshTPP9pr\":\"The \u003ca\u003ePro plan\u003c/a\u003e gives you everything in a Free plan with more usage and more of Claude's capabilities. That includes Claude Code, along with projects to organize your chats and documents, access to more Claude models, and Claude for Microsoft 365. You can choose a monthly or annual subscription.\",\"RZOLOQYGvV\":\"Trending now\",\"RdwN9i9j97\":\"Claude is an AI assistant built by Anthropic and designed to be helpful, honest, and harmless, so you can do your best work.\",\"RfG2KsHAez\":\"Computer use\",\"Rh+bJsNatj\":\"Pause video\",\"RhKJ2/dzyi\":\"Get current pricing for our five competitors.\",\"RkmePydx59\":\"Student and faculty access\",\"Rm96NytXxa\":\"Model training\",\"RrEC5/uqbJ\":\"Standard seat\",\"RuG7Xh/ujS\":\"Jumpstart for SMB\",\"S++WdBsywt\":\"Read more\",\"S3/G+/dD4A\":\"Budget\",\"S6f8L9AmRO\":\"legal teams\",\"SBfAkairO8\":\", \",\"SPdWduUedU\":\"Role-based access\",\"SQyIemQQu3\":\"Register now\",\"SSgXfU4P5V\":\"Tiered incentives on committed spend\",\"SUQPEIcWfW\":\"Search partners\",\"SZaT2AdIUl\":\"What developers are saying\",\"Sd6Jw71DZP\":\"Put together the QBR for Northfield.\",\"Seanpxav9K\":\"Required\",\"SiUzDOe8i6\":\"Upcoming | Multiple dates\",\"Suh09n2FlY\":\"Sales \u0026 Revenue Operations\","])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"\"T0LvAV0imS\":\"Hybrid (on-site + remote)\",\"T2+nidMjEx\":\"Adding seats midterm\",\"T3akMQ803X\":\"$$0.08 per session-hour for active runtime\",\"T5SvjYYLIb\":\"How much text, code, or conversation Claude can handle at once. Context window varies by model — see \u003ca\u003econtext window sizes\u003c/a\u003e for current limits.\",\"TCG/mrpB14\":\"Read\",\"TCWmACgN0S\":\"Search your company's internal docs and data, not just the web.\",\"TDaF6JVgG6\":\"Dismiss\",\"TFqOUdkTad\":\"Claude Code documentation\",\"TI79WvQ5kU\":\"Single sign-on (SSO)\",\"TJEhp8h+U3\":\"More Claude models\",\"TLd8GRYX8Y\":\"Capability sections\",\"TYMQIfyurZ\":\"Read the NA and EMEA actuals\",\"TZpKxTntMG\":\"Create Artifacts\",\"TaegquRpTn\":\"Developer docs\",\"TdTXXf940t\":\"Learn more\",\"TkDcZajDzk\":\"Latest feature announcements\",\"TkYZBTRXHQ\":\"Customers\",\"TpciDWqNPD\":\"Custom connectors and MCPs\",\"TqlgrXGqZt\":\"Industry\",\"Tx3sTBKi+Z\":\"FAQ\",\"TyE4PlkMfX\":\"Via usage credits for users on subscription plans.\",\"TzE6GnXLOB\":\"How much does Claude Code cost?\",\"UDRX5qxC1r\":\"Financial services\",\"UFjqbmk8kM\":\"Q2. Ours.\",\"ULRaOPIG49\":\"Included\",\"UPap4fX6ma\":\"Explore more product news and best practices for teams building with Claude.\",\"UQE0bYmzVh\":\"Write\",\"USjZg+86TM\":\"Domain verification\",\"UUlfcFwV/3\":\"Search agents and products\",\"UWzSpf6oVC\":\"Recurring webinars\",\"UaMS2SAJcK\":\"Deliver the proof sheet: three 4:5 posts\",\"UaOvI9nNMi\":\"Preferred\",\"Uexi10BG3g\":\"Conversation \u0026 Meeting Intelligence\",\"UjUodGARy4\":\"Agent Skills\",\"Ur2qDTaYRT\":\"If you subscribed through Google Play, \u003ca\u003econtact our Support team\u003c/a\u003e to check eligibility for an active subscription.\",\"Uu3DS2OciX\":\"Partners\",\"Uuv0CtbZoq\":\"Seek testimonial audio\",\"UxTJRaKagI\":\"Projects\",\"Uz6cSwEs5f\":\"Draft the memo, precedent first\",\"V3DZSAgwS0\":\"No commitment · Cancel anytime\",\"VHD4aUZXCE\":\"System for Cross-domain Identity Management (SCIM)\",\"VKb1MSJZP+\":\"Categories\",\"VKezrLLhJ3\":\"By topic\",\"VKfWR3F5qV\":\"Recommended\",\"VMSk3mg7Wm\":\"$$100/month\",\"VQQnUhOsqR\":\"eBook\",\"VSiWvvTsR3\":\"Everything Claude brings to your work, grouped the way the map draws it. Each capability links out to its product page or docs.\",\"VT39YIwHAi\":\"Every Monday, pull last week’s web, ad, and channel numbers from Amplitude and BigQuery, compare to the week before, flag anything that moved more than 10%, and put it in a deck I can review before it goes out.\",\"VdjlTKzJON\":\"Privacy choices\",\"Vj+Jl5qvvf\":\"Plans \u0026 pricing | Claude by Anthropic\",\"VmSBxZ62qb\":\"Yes. Pro, Max, Ultra, Team, and Enterprise users can access Claude Code on the \u003ca\u003eClaude desktop app\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"Vn/B4Q2FzQ\":\"By continuing, you acknowledge Anthropic's \u003ca\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e and agree to get occasional promotional emails and notifications.\",\"VuaUNdEnAQ\":\"Pull every document tagged to the witness in Everlaw, build a chronology of key events, and put deposition questions in a spreadsheet, organized by topic, one row per question, with the supporting document cited and a column to mark each one covered.\",\"VxbwOIgVP3\":\"Reading the brand guidelines before designing anything\",\"W+iNcuRf/j\":\"For your longest tasks\",\"W0P+kwxx4c\":\"South Korea\",\"W0Tn8YkSr3\":\"Contact sales\",\"W314oPyAYP\":\"Claude Fable models are included in premium seats up to 50% of each member's weekly usage limit. Standard seats can use them with usage credits enabled. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e\",\"W8nHSdskn0\":\"FAQ\",\"WAMokYC7m5\":\"Mix and match seat types\",\"WE0vBEA1sf\":\"\u003cb\u003eMore usage than Free\u003c/b\u003e, every 5 hours and every week\",\"WFI1cVp5a+\":\"{name} — in use in this session\",\"WGjpyApkxf\":\"Role-based access with fine grained permissioning\",\"WQAQ7xuRtl\":\"Super powerful terminal integration. Works with all your CLI tools alongside popular IDEs.\",\"Wc8Q9lHK1i\":\"Training and enablement\",\"WfvMAnxldt\":\"No resources for this search\",\"WiUsl4KQxR\":\"Show original\",\"WiwUy/N7ng\":\"Claude Code included\",\"Wj0bEDoJdu\":\"Intro\",\"WlfPoKGwAm\":\"Not required\",\"Wm3wd0VKYa\":\"Flag seven rows, hold four decisions\",\"WrDUUzCpU7\":\"Jump to a session using {name}\",\"Wufzvy8DSX\":\"Table of Contents\",\"WxzMBlTNvA\":\"Play: {title}\",\"WznK3aUpMC\":\"{title} — ask\",\"X+NNn3hjCL\":\"No matching {noun}\",\"X+PvShAt/r\":\"Claude Code by Anthropic | AI"])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1," coding agent and assistant\",\"X3MpW7VpdQ\":\"See it in action\",\"X65e4nNr6A\":\"Pull the latest earnings transcript and 10-Q for Dunhollow. Extract guidance, key KPIs, and commentary, compare to last quarter, and build a comps table against these peers.\",\"X6AvQomsP7\":\"Enterprise deployment for the Claude desktop app\",\"X6cK197KO5\":\"Claude for Microsoft 365\",\"X7+QFFH+jU\":\"Testimonials\",\"X95+EHwJll\":\"Open headcount-plan-v3.xlsx\",\"XCDfO+clUB\":\"I'm in \u003crole\u003e\u003c/role\u003e and I need to make the \u003ctask\u003e\u003c/task\u003e.\",\"XIsYfwEKec\":\"Write the brief\",\"XLcM6WHfQR\":\"How can I help you today?\",\"XMNoObaMmU\":\"{label}, go to the {time} card\",\"XNAhzcTNYL\":\"Run Python code in a sandboxed environment for advanced data analysis. 50 free hours of usage daily per organization.\",\"XNmgJt+Mhl\":\"All connectors\",\"XQtVbW2vWT\":\"Mark seven changes, three leveling, four fairness\",\"XTD3qNXeer\":\"In research preview on Claude Code, and is priced at $8/$40 per million tokens.\",\"XXnChAbcHf\":\"Nonprofit\",\"XXo1ivOIKB\":\"Missed the session? Stream past sessions anytime and catch up at your own pace.\",\"XY0a0CkaN4\":\"Remote — nearshore\",\"XYIVAj6Jzp\":\"Link your tools and apps, like Google Workspace or Slack, directly to Claude.\",\"Xd+A22wS4X\":\"5x more usage than standard seats*\",\"XgN4Cp51ra\":\"See pricing\",\"XoZI2iCtxL\":\"Claude Design\",\"Xp6OIvNBd2\":\"Pause testimonial audio\",\"XsXqMtdytZ\":\"Visit eight flagged sites and screenshot each\",\"XyoSUUQClA\":\"For: {label}\",\"Y/c6Wmsfjz\":\"On demand webinars\",\"YE4RPpBEqQ\":\"Now standing: after every meeting this week\",\"YKGWJSxqMY\":\"Read story\",\"YLao9+QH8h\":\"Please provide your email address if you'd like to receive our monthly developer newsletter. You can unsubscribe at any time.\",\"YMDBNHdbce\":\"Geography\",\"YMzwquqk3o\":\"Link\",\"YQQOy0ihRy\":\"Featured speakers\",\"YUPzJoJpNc\":\"Choose whether your conversations are used to improve Claude. Off by default for Team and Enterprise plans.\",\"YYX063a6ZG\":\"Search the web, create files, and run code\",\"YYot3EpUou\":\"$$20\",\"YbKpD7kDX6\":\"Interactive\",\"YkE126+GiX\":\"Up to 1M\",\"YkNJyv//Oz\":\"Trust \u0026 Safety / Platform Integrity\",\"YuZ2EYYkhH\":\"How do I get started with Claude?\",\"Yv6dvxCCkS\":\"Consumer health\",\"YxMv5HcMwA\":\"Monthly API credits\u003csup\u003e†\u003c/sup\u003e\",\"Z7xDUpgJ2K\":\"Billing cycle\",\"Z9dVg8Ob8p\":\"Claude Code follows imports across the repo, runs your tests, and keeps going when something breaks.\",\"ZG1gU8s28h\":\"Stay in control\",\"ZNBW49D95o\":\"Fill out the form below to watch on demand.\",\"ZXp0z1T7ZD\":\"Features\",\"ZYpCu5TyqM\":\"{count, plural, one {Advanced filters, # active} other {Advanced filters, # active}}\",\"ZcD4mRk7ZH\":\"There are two headcount plans in the folder — v3 is newer, but v2 still carries the contractor lines. Which is the plan of record?\",\"Zf7kOX3YGK\":\"Browse and act on the web through Claude in Chrome and the built-in browser.\",\"ZydsS37EBY\":\"Search resources\",\"Zz6QTaW0y5\":\"Available for macOS, Linux, and Windows.\",\"a10yUyliJu\":\"Fable\",\"a5LrLs/sa2\":\"Previous testimonial\",\"a5msuh5ORp\":\"Yes\",\"a5n8z1LKFj\":\"Southern Europe\",\"aC/Bx71odA\":\"Carousel\",\"aF7o2f3nQS\":\"Turn issues into PRs\",\"aMBJ4XnoAo\":\"How this customer uses Claude\",\"aPJQXN+s9F\":\"Close video\",\"aV5lC7ot7c\":\"Next generation intelligence for long-running agents\",\"aV6+0k71tl\":\"50% of weekly limits*\",\"aXlmhJkMcl\":\"Back to\",\"aakFT06xnt\":\"Install in\",\"adJ3dNrecS\":\"Compliance \u0026 Regulatory\",\"adO4gdcCQz\":\"Open Legal/Playbook.docx\",\"af7XCyr+Dn\":\"For all-day work\",\"agOXPD4vII\":\"Size\",\"ahrZTRwglI\":\"partners\",\"aw3LoyutxL\":\"Ultra\",\"awWVTjGGM5\":\"Code Review\",\"aymdcv0bFB\":\"Per seat / month if billed annually. For teams of 2 to 150.\",\"ayxgE4ytwj\":\"Modify prompt\",\"azQRa7pYOp\":\"View changelog\",\"b6NDBQ9q9p\":\"View all results\",\"b6ygXcySyV\":\"Copy\",\"b8CyirwlZS\":\"Read the feature-adoption export\",\"b8bQ/2BLrg\":\"No partners for those filters\",\"bDI8xySdWR\":\"Run several tasks with Claude at the same time.\",\"bELf2s68U0\":\"Download for Linux\",\"bK12e7jHSb\":\"Install iOS app\",\"bKcIulyCC6\":\"Read #team-atlas, Aug 11–15\",\"bL/ieQDt4B\":\"How Anthropic teams use Claude Code\",\"bRTlGXiR5x\":\"Plans and usage\",\"bRirJ/xRnf\":\"Internal Agentic Platform Build\",\"bURn5drAe5\":\"Standard list prices for "])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"Claude models across all platforms.\",\"bVH9+xPCco\":\": {products}\",\"bW7B87wFFp\":\"New\",\"bYBBZf/OaR\":\"\u003cb\u003eCode Review:\u003c/b\u003e Catch more bugs before they reach production. Now generally available for Team and Enterprise.\",\"bic4YlbCO4\":\"on premium seats\",\"biijo1+gxc\":\"Desktop extensions\",\"bjOAXx9K3d\":\"stack\",\"bnA+KjYQz7\":\"Enterprise search\",\"bsQoQHASoV\":\"Is Claude Code included in my plan?\",\"c/KktLImbB\":\"Resources\",\"c0cvfUTeO0\":\"Up to 5\",\"c0l64iyI9x\":\"The Northfield MSA came back. Check it against our playbook and mark it up.\",\"c1zgtNFdB8\":\"Premium seat\",\"c35gM5T7cu\":\"Roles\",\"c4F8flHdZY\":\"Shareable, on-brand designs, slides, and documents. Edit yourself or tell Claude what to change.\",\"c4qcb9yX+3\":\"Write the readout, priorities first\",\"c7T+CiWeMf\":\"carousel\",\"cHXyPLuQFl\":\"Introduction to agentic coding\",\"cKxn2XT2rG\":\"View latest card\",\"cMQMhpROAU\":\"Business Process \u0026 Operations\",\"cPwv2cbzf2\":\"Privacy policy\",\"cZGJUsrgnV\":\"On Team plans, an Owner or Primary Owner manages this under Organization settings \u003e Billing. \u003ca\u003eSee more details here\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"cb2kY6mIKz\":\"Standard\",\"ccXLViZC/1\":\"Category\",\"cfwppHkhgo\":\"{minutes} min\",\"cgAJ/0uxrL\":\"I’ve got a call with Meridian at 2 and I know nothing about it.\",\"chVRqHkSZV\":\"Available to Enterprise users when enabled by an org admin.\",\"chtpmBtB0E\":\"No resources here yet — check back soon.\",\"ctSkb8EVSE\":\"Post to #marketing\",\"cvwrTSWr0m\":\"Action tracking\",\"cyi/ZwsQZR\":\"Interactive visuals\",\"d3pCKHbCKH\":\"Education \u0026 Learning\",\"d9M7UWrt5D\":\"Every Monday morning, pull last week’s views and signups from Amplitude and ad spend from BigQuery, compare to the week before, flag anything that moved more than 10%, and post the readout to #marketing.\",\"dC3u7ZxCFj\":\"Most popular\",\"dCgoDvDFox\":\"Claude in Chrome and Microsoft 365\",\"dG9CoZc8NU\":\"IP allowlisting\",\"dK2xpmCXrt\":\"Webinar registration\",\"dKiMz8lQ7p\":\"Security and administration\",\"dO64AQ4kX2\":\"All Team plan features, plus:\",\"dVx3yznM2C\":\"Memory\",\"dfi1nLeYHA\":\"\u003cb\u003eMods:\u003c/b\u003e Change how Claude Code behaves and looks with a few lines of TypeScript. Available in the CLI and desktop app.\",\"dg3jRxBmz9\":\"Video: {title}\",\"dz5w/57op2\":\"Search Claude Marketplace\",\"e3h3Y/N2kI\":\"Related connectors\",\"e480V1RWKN\":\"Customer stories\",\"e61Jf3TcmS\":\"Coming soon\",\"e7sGZ88Qnl\":\"Product: {label}\",\"eGAbmRne5j\":\"Industry Solution Accelerator Deployment\",\"eHY3S25m6z\":\"Chapter navigation\",\"eW5eoWkxy3\":\"Artifacts\",\"eW9hutaHeF\":\"Check the draft against leveling guide v4\",\"eYENP/pkgh\":\"Software Development\",\"eZPOl0kWMZ\":\"Read the deal thread, Jun 30 – Aug 14\",\"ede6BSFS4Y\":\"Scan your codebase for vulnerabilities, validate findings, and generate suggested patches.\",\"egHChszzD6\":\"{type} access form\",\"ejEGdxSUGs\":\"Home\",\"ejTJMzAwFF\":\"Does Claude offer volume discounts?\",\"el7wVC1bkn\":\"Featured resource {position} of {count}: {title}\",\"elTyFoO5eR\":\"Choose the Claude plan that fits how you solve problems. Free, Pro, Max, Ultra, Team, and Enterprise tiers, plus API pricing for developers.\",\"emgl65lJkN\":\"Organization wide skills deployment\",\"epieNNdeXY\":\"Claude Code is moving our team up a level: we decide what needs to happen, and smooth the process so it can build and verify end-to-end. A big part of my job now is to keep as many instances of Claude Code busy as possible.\",\"euiA1H61OH\":\"Customers outside of Europe can follow this process to \u003ca\u003erequest a refund\u003c/a\u003e:\",\"eylXO8YdWn\":\"Build the slide, comps table behind it\",\"f6NhKWst8e\":\"Other plugins\",\"fA/6QacBaf\":\"Prompts \u003e {threshold} tokens\",\"fBG/GeW9Uc\":\"Cost\",\"fC/+2oE3HG\":\"Results for “{query}”\",\"fEE0vf8ygf\":\"Not included\",\"fGpRdLrMdV\":\"Does Claude Code work with the Claude desktop app?\",\"fIg106zNao\":\"slide\",\"fIxDjT+aMY\":\"Splitting decisions from action items first\",\"fL3yWFg4Na\":\"Video player\",\"fPBr/eGp6u\":\"Document Processing \u0026 Extraction\",\"fY8+6FRyY8\":\"Incognito chats\",\"fcJZnHsPVl\":\"$1d\",\"fde27wEzOW\":\"Payment options\",\"filwqDWORF\":\"Read\",\"fio5opLcOZ\":\"Output\",\"fkihPk7bb3\":\"All partners\",\"flmC4rLQFi\":\"Advanced filters\",\"fmU7fKJTzY\":\"Claude Training Sessions\",\"fubYuebYh9\":\"Access anywhere\",\"fvA4lXfkP8\":\"Staff Augmentation\",\"f"])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"vM1wggKTE\":\"Short, focused reads that break down one idea, workflow, or capability at a time.\",\"fwIt1XEa99\":\"Newest\",\"g/w+MbxOr0\":\"Developer tools\",\"g92wTHEZD1\":\"Go to featured resource {position} of {count}\",\"gB7KNBbkYl\":\"You can change your plan any time in Settings.\",\"gBuMx1gcTM\":\"For large businesses operating at scale\",\"gD8K+LHoq/\":\"Consolidate and flag three variances\",\"gTjHrV/Zd2\":\"Try in Claude\",\"gVc7XkWaqo\":\"Quick access from browser, mobile app, or Claude on desktop. Great for parallel work or on-the-go coding.\",\"gY4tNnNQOH\":\"By purchasing, deploying, accessing, or using this product, you agree to comply with the provider’s terms of service and the terms of any applicable open source software licenses bundled with the product. Providers are responsible for their product descriptions and product content. Anthropic does not warrant provider content is accurate, complete, or error-free.\",\"gczcC5Leue\":\"Subscribe\",\"gfBsTzP5ye\":\"Fable, paid with usage credits\",\"gfLW5gLfXn\":\"Code, apps, and docs that Claude builds for you to use, share, or build on.\",\"gjyzc7CoPw\":\"Table of contents\",\"goHQnK7riz\":\"find service partners\",\"gx7hEPtG+7\":\"DevOps \u0026 Infrastructure Operations\",\"h0W8DMh59C\":\"Time of day\",\"h1ZCL0rm+U\":\"Using CLAUDE.md files\",\"h5xR/rI1JW\":\"Enjoy the video here. Check out other relevant on-demand or upcoming webinars next.\",\"h74ZyMoIiy\":\"Date\",\"h7XvE8ATgC\":\"Previous featured resource\",\"h8BJNSpLyh\":\"Japan\",\"hDI+JMUhFd\":\"Sort by\",\"hFM4GcbPOu\":\"Healthcare \u0026 Life Sciences\",\"hIRpbSURfI\":\"Webinar series registration\",\"hIlb3S7gmj\":\"creative teams\",\"hJZwTSF8Wx\":\"Email address\",\"hVIGR3ZwM1\":\"Start reading\",\"hVIj7YDDnl\":\"Limited\",\"hcYW3zYnp0\":\"Close {heading}\",\"hccqYXg/9+\":\"For asynchronous workloads that can be processed together for better efficiency\",\"hgWdf2UIOg\":\"Claude product overview\",\"hiWuJZvDP+\":\"Related articles\",\"hjGm1j2qcj\":\"Work with the files and folders already on your desktop.\",\"hnrY3LI/l8\":\"Plugin source\",\"hsFxxRwOuF\":\"Play testimonial audio\",\"hvATMfbD6N\":\"Get started with Claude Code\",\"hvD2/48aAq\":\"Admins set user and org spend limits\",\"hySAiYaQPB\":\"Customer story: {name}\",\"hzIXh+zWXq\":\"Sign-in\",\"i6/NVPwbXS\":\"Set org instructions\",\"i6X4YUnoI+\":\"Code execution\",\"iA09r91Nhi\":\"Data Analysis \u0026 Business Intelligence\",\"iKZ+rED3h9\":\"Search the Claude Marketplace\",\"iQYFHFpp2/\":\"Start building\",\"iSqBnkauND\":\"Show featured resource {position} of {count}: {title}\",\"iUZG3VKE6X\":\"Batch\",\"iXpep1vGVo\":\"Recent\",\"iY7lfhlPVd\":\"Keep context, instructions, and files organized by project.\",\"iYRFrGt6Mf\":\"$$200\",\"iZxsimeRjv\":\"Play video: {name}\",\"ia3TbSw0MB\":\"Anthropic Products\",\"igUl+YO/B4\":\"Claude takes real actions on your files and in connected tools. You choose which plugins Claude can use — it works only in the folders and tools you allow.\",\"ih0VppR08P\":\"{n} of {count}\",\"ii5+AISEyS\":\"\u003ca\u003eUsage limits apply\u003c/a\u003e. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"ijMdGR7OO4\":\"Cross-check 34 issues and 34 PRs\",\"inUkccnHv6\":\"Set preferences that apply across every conversation.\",\"ioH+Q/t3aY\":\"See all features and pricing\",\"isGKnzG5uL\":\"Documentation\",\"it6Ligcq3B\":\"Input\",\"iuSNLHoe8Z\":\"Get a comprehensive university‐wide plan for an institution, including its students, faculty, and staff.\",\"iun6grW2C+\":\"Claude Consumption / FinOps Optimisation\",\"iwE5pm/oXq\":\"Contract redline\",\"ize18jQXCF\":\"Now standing: Mondays before staff meeting\",\"j/NXahNfg2\":\"Briefs\",\"j2hlcpE79k\":\"Browser use\",\"jB1nSrwP8X\":\"{count, plural, one {# webinar} other {# webinars}}\",\"jCxscTUx/w\":\"Watch the recording\",\"jI62MY64Qn\":\"Other\",\"jKKg2of6uk\":\"Clear all filters\",\"jLXY9o1l5R\":\"Customer success support at certain spend thresholds\",\"jSd3FgIcuH\":\"Step-by-step walkthroughs and practical playbooks for getting the most out of Claude.\",\"jWt3I/bVbN\":\"Save 50% with batch processing. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e\",\"jcwE2sEK9f\":\"Connects with your favorite command line tools\",\"jeFrcRK7Eo\":\"Claude Code is included in your Max plan. Great value for everyday use in larger codebases. Includes $100 per month in API credits.\",\"jewMdfuvaC\":\"{variant, select, brief {"])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"Next brief} report {Next report} other {Next guide}}\",\"jfCrPjcoTy\":\"Alphabetically (Z to A)\",\"jg76pPXsb3\":\"How fast you reach a limit depends on the model you use, how long your chats are, and how large your files are.\",\"jgPXwd1foX\":\"Product:\",\"jhr0P2VITB\":\"Managed AI Operations\",\"jm/spnRSn+\":\"Reset\",\"js+IVaPpb9\":\"Chapter {number}\",\"jsHFp13ghq\":\"Demos, talks, and tutorials from the teams building and using Claude.\",\"jtygmIHCQ1\":\"Education\",\"jvODrZtR+p\":\"Select\",\"jw+K5d+CdN\":\"When used with a Claude Console account, Claude Code consumes API tokens at standard API pricing.\",\"jw7DDs8FJv\":\"Office Locations (On-Site Services)\",\"jx7Hn3QkH8\":\"Article\",\"k0OtSnRsC6\":\"Claude Code is designed with security in mind. When used in your terminal, Claude Code runs locally and talks directly to model APIs without requiring a backend server or remote code index. It also asks for permission before making changes to your files or running commands.\",\"k2veDAJW1p\":\"Write\",\"k4+9FsLhU8\":\"On consumption-based plans.\",\"k8cDUYjZKq\":\"Add to Claude\",\"kBJUtE9oHc\":\"Video\",\"kBa7elYtHL\":\"Earnings comps\",\"kFe6I3hifr\":\"Close capabilities\",\"kG2B8TG1wp\":\"Up to $500/month\",\"kGPBjqFz6l\":\"Prices shown don’t include applicable tax. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"kVrpkF04ro\":\"Webinars\",\"kdUZJIKMMe\":\"Global (any region)\",\"kfiCd53EoX\":\"stories\",\"kh/sk1M1PF\":\"Here are this month’s regional actuals exports. Reconcile them into one summary, flag any variances against budget, and note anything that doesn’t tie out.\",\"khjKGjoVqR\":\"View source\",\"kkjl2vQekD\":\"Max\",\"kkm29b5t2g\":\"Connectors, plugins and API integrations\",\"kmWDaKdQa7\":\"Downgrades take effect at the end of your current billing period, and your chats, projects, and files stay with your account whichever plan you're on.\",\"krcRxpVfJ7\":\"Travel \u0026 Hospitality\",\"ktRQ8OmQ1C\":\"If you're in the European Economic Area and the United Kingdom, and within your 14-day withdrawal period, you can request a refund directly in the app.\",\"kvOMtBRD9I\":\"Credit card\",\"kwoQygB+wc\":\"Canceling doesn't delete your data. Your chats, projects, and files stay with your account, though some features aren't available on the Free plan. For Pro, Max, and Ultra, your account moves to the Free plan once the period ends. For step-by-step help, see \u003ca\u003ehow to cancel a Pro, Max, or Ultra plan\u003c/a\u003e or \u003cb\u003ecancel a Team plan\u003c/b\u003e.\",\"kxmEvL+JcO\":\"\u003ca\u003eMax and Ultra\u003c/a\u003e are built for people who work with Claude throughout the day and want longer, uninterrupted sessions. You get everything in Pro, plus more usage. Max gives you 5x the usage of Pro, every 5 hours and every week. Ultra gives you 10x the weekly usage of Pro, with no 5-hour limit for \u003cb\u003everified accounts\u003c/b\u003e. Both plans include Fable, our top model, for up to half your weekly limit, and a monthly API credit to build on the Claude Platform: $100 on Max, $200 on Ultra. Both plans are billed monthly. See the cards above for current pricing.\",\"kyuy4QAduP\":\"The board deck five. Whatever tier they push hardest.\",\"kzQgd/+809\":\"Product overview\",\"l/bdoV65Uq\":\"Close (Esc)\",\"l0cx8sfvyN\":\"Consultation\",\"l6yCDglZqT\":\"Continue with email\",\"lBAoMMkYNE\":\"Horizontal / Cross-industry\",\"lDLuhpAPUD\":\"Opus\",\"lN0CJi045d\":\"Permissions control\",\"lRdUjp0Vbo\":\"Files and folders\",\"lVREK+O2A7\":\"Claude Security (beta)\",\"lXFbqgnTzj\":\"Hand off and schedule tasks\",\"lbr3Lq2Lnm\":\"Copy link\",\"lbtOA3j+V3\":\"Require that any accounts using your domain migrate to your organization\",\"lcRZ9HSjkB\":\"Administrative tools for Team and Enterprise\",\"lcjzsP/DJa\":\"Per month with annual subscription discount (\u003cannual\u003e$200\u003c/annual\u003e billed up front). \u003cmonthly\u003e$20\u003c/monthly\u003e if billed monthly.\",\"lgU1HeQGw4\":\"Global Premier\",\"lh0xe+kwtT\":\"Works with\",\"ll/ufR0/ED\":\"Trending\",\"lpFUMU324g\":\"Compliance API for observability and monitoring\",\"lu3AvZt5aS\":\"Research, benchmarks, and analysis on how AI is changing the way organizations build, plan, and operate.\",\"ludPcY9ukn\":\"Compare features across plans\",\"lw49qiF68V\":\"Let Claude write and run code to build files like spreadsheets, presentations, and docs for you.\""])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,",\"m0TzBiIhvZ\":\"Central billing and administration\",\"m7v1ahj/te\":\"Native extensions for VS Code (+ Cursor, Devin Desktop) and JetBrains IDEs.\",\"mABpZRe7C5\":\"The developer newsletter\",\"mG4nNtNqKg\":\"Updated {date}\",\"mIV5za3QLY\":\"Draft 11 field updates, nothing saved\",\"mKkfuHn2hN\":\"More information\",\"mVaGK86OHA\":\"From {tool}\",\"mVkTZZgH2a\":\"Plugin\",\"mWIVle/RBJ\":\"Date\",\"mWPRGNJ4Uw\":\"Convert EMEA at the July average, 1.088\",\"mWVI74nTV2\":\"Ask and artifact\",\"meOv8JJVYB\":\"Chat with buying specialist\",\"mnJYBQZwb4\":\"Voice\",\"mofX8KnW9/\":\"Claude Code works on macOS, Linux, and Windows. \u003ca\u003eSee full system requirements\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"mscD97HgEg\":\"Managed / Recurring\",\"mwHr7Se8D1\":\"Access to Claude’s latest models for reasoning, coding, and writing.\",\"mxnaO8gi08\":\"Claude lives inside Chrome, ready wherever you browse.\",\"myTIbit5tv\":\"Select partners\",\"mynHYVUSOV\":\"Nordics\",\"n469UeWQIf\":\"Download for ChromeOS\",\"n5D/KuWRGi\":\"Communication\",\"nEA1MxORgH\":\"For {role}\",\"nL8xcmnbjm\":\"Write the digest, what-to-watch first\",\"nOk9mhxGpU\":\"List\",\"nPtgyxpUd0\":\"How do I cancel my Claude subscription?\",\"nScLeP89Ov\":\"Migrate code\",\"nTMLK2RYtE\":\"Deployment Surface\",\"nUT0LvZVOx\":\"Tools\",\"nYokoOMWQh\":\"See solution\",\"nb4F4k82C7\":\"Search {text}\",\"nezp0LIXpQ\":\"Claude Code understands your codebase, edits files, runs commands, and helps you ship faster. It’s Anthropic’s agentic coding tool for your terminal and IDE.\",\"njpnaOi5/X\":\"Resume video\",\"noi6IWMyXA\":\"Project / Program\",\"npxjiYSnPH\":\"v3. Contractors moved to the ops budget.\",\"nx8x3WZ4/G\":\"enterprise security\",\"o+ToCFnM8m\":\"Turn on permissions settings so Claude shows its plan and waits for your approval. Redirect or stop anytime.\",\"o/AcDuEdCh\":\"Create what’s exciting. Maintain what’s essential.\",\"o4eiiyba8k\":\"Compare against Q1\",\"oEZ3tJt0N9\":\"Here’s a list of flagged sites. Visit each one, take a screenshot, and triage it against our trademark enforcement playbook. Rank them by priority.\",\"oFLooU1/QL\":\"{minutes} min remaining\",\"oGju2hB9//\":\"Compliance API\",\"oJiyzDUmhQ\":\"Claude Code has dramatically accelerated our team's coding efficiency. I can now write EDA code in a notebook—pulling data, training a model, and evaluating it with basic metrics—and then ask Claude to convert that into a Metaflow pipeline. This process saves 1-2 days of routine (and often boring!) work per model.\",\"oKdO3Ime5c\":\"Build a social set for the Fall Readout using our brand guidelines. Three 4:5 posts — a stat, a headline, and a trend — as one proof sheet.\",\"oNedMwBIOc\":\"Fable included, up to half your weekly limit\",\"oNxIDnOk31\":\"Post the roll-up in-channel\",\"oUWADlOjJt\":\"No\",\"oZA/6fiLF8\":\"Partner tier\",\"ocMFdUoM0+\":\"{name} is available through the Claude Marketplace. If you have an existing Anthropic commitment, you can apply it here. Contact our team to find the right path for your organization.\",\"odMy5ERU7S\":\"Quick answers or long tasks\",\"ohjvu+C87x\":\"Active users\",\"onyxL5iLxe\":\"{count, plural, other {# more}}\",\"onz7SZxGnk\":\"Build Prototype / POC\",\"otTZisSg5A\":\"If you subscribed through the App Store or Google Play, cancel from that app under Billing \u003e Manage subscription, or directly in your \u003ca\u003eApple\u003c/a\u003e or \u003cb\u003eGoogle Play\u003c/b\u003e account.\",\"ox9wXewvNY\":\"Check the week’s meetings, next team sync Thursday\",\"p556q3uvbn\":\"Copied\",\"p64wBxVoxB\":\"Claude Code maps and explains large codebases in a few seconds. It uses agentic search to understand project structure and dependencies without you having to manually select context files.\",\"p6McXlpoIr\":\"Claude Code for every seat, with self-serve seat management and up to $500 per month in pooled API credits.\",\"p7f+VL1U+Y\":\"Swipe to see more\",\"p8Zpb+X9Sa\":\"You can access Claude Code with a Claude Pro, Max, or Ultra plan, a Team or Enterprise plan, or a Claude Console account. \u003ca\u003eDownload Claude Code\u003c/a\u003e and sign in with your respective Claude or Console credentials.\",\"pCl8kahPwa\":\"Next testimonials\",\"pCyFJadqy/\":\"Simon Last, Co-founder\",\"pFZfPaYqm/\":\"n/a\",\"pGLybCbau7\":\"New connectors\",\"pJx1IlMdHc\":\"Each entry is a fixed snapshot of prices effective on the date shown.\",\"pK+9X32E"])</script><script 