ywork so you can focus on what matters most, and so much more.\",\"vdH+AniQsJ\":\"\u003cb\u003eLimited usage\u003c/b\u003e every 5 hours and every week\",\"vgDovOlJoC\":\"Restrict org creation\",\"vhBuSQQwT8\":\"No matches for “{query}” across connectors, plugins, products, or partners.\",\"vjjcLxOenJ\":\"\u003ca\u003eUsage limits\u003c/a\u003e apply.\",\"vk9SGKd88w\":\"Using the People readout skill, so the shape matches last wave\",\"vox7qN7azl\":\"View use case\",\"vt9Gy7rhLn\":\"Company Size\",\"vwbw+n92T7\":\"Webinar\",\"vzkkN2jQqo\":\"Claude Marketplace\",\"w0lpGgj9J9\":\"Build your own connectors and MCPs, including local desktop extensions.\",\"wB8Eqc+qG4\":\"Talk to Claude instead of typing.\",\"wIZFIV6YhG\":\"Top connectors\",\"wKxQbCASEj\":\"{tier} partners\",\"wM6oUsyOof\":\"Build seven slides, one per channel\",\"wPtxxpRiKQ\":\"Rate cards\",\"wYsv4ZHu+B\":\"Monthly\",\"watRo3fhKU\":\"”\",\"wdim+3jQow\":\"Finished, editable work\",\"wjZOFtnIbc\":\"Get more out of Claude with advanced features and capabilities.\",\"wnLG2QD6dp\":\"More webinar series from Anthropic experts and the teams building with Claude in production.\",\"wsUmh9XWBm\":\"Team\",\"wswV88oI1C\":\"No products for those filters\",\"wtBmSVW9UH\":\"All resources\",\"wuV8/3bexC\":\"Claude Code on web and mobile\",\"ww0M7Vl2w/\":\"Matching themes to roadmap items before counting\",\"wwSEfV+DLR\":\"Build charts, diagrams, and interactive visuals right in the conversation.\",\"wzT0WOVyaw\":\"(Current rate card)\",\"x/ZVlUTP1H\":\"Product\",\"x0W7xxxEcv\":\"Web search\",\"x49BetgMxt\":\"For workloads that need to run in the US, US-only inference is available at 1.1x pricing for input and output tokens. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"x5Tz6MZH82\":\"Report\",\"xDe1e0b5He\":\"Build and deploy agents at scale with a suite of composable APIs. Standard token rates apply.\",\"xEdLVyUWKy\":\"{count, plural, one {# suggestion available} other {# suggestions available}}\",\"xKT9sxXpth\":\"The re