L55\",null,\"$L56\",\"$L57\"]}],\"$L58\",false]}]}],\"$undefined\"]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"6646631ba8f0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L59\",null,{\"moduleIds\":[\"2987325626256474013\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L5a\",null,{\"anchor\":\"panel\",\"eyebrow\":\"BETA\",\"headline\":\"Built-in capabilities for every agent\",\"lead\":null,\"leadText\":null,\"blocks\":[{\"kind\":\"row\",\"key\":\"f4040a24f4a8\",\"title\":\"Multiagent orchestration\",\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"c4ccbc4516db\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"e3f6ae055b76\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Claude delegates to other agents, each with its own independent context window.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]},{\"kind\":\"row\",\"key\":\"4dc4ed73368c\",\"title\":\"Outcomes\",\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"8dc3ba953394\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"12f466f041b3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Agents iterate against pre-defined exit criteria, grading their own work against a rubric.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]},{\"kind\":\"row\",\"key\":\"c76e1d729145\",\"title\":\"Memory tool\",\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"f79e06729992\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"48e1c3dd3906\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Claude reads and writes to memory stores, so every session gets progressively better.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]},{\"kind\":\"row\",\"key\":\"45e81e569aa7\",\"title\":\"Scheduled deployments\",\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"34719a6d3ea5\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"152b14e0d992\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Run agents on a schedule, so recurring work happens without having to trigger a run.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]},{\"kind\":\"row\",\"key\":\"528b22871729\",\"title\":\"Self-hosted sandboxes\",\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"129ca3e8460c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"fb4a74dacdad\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Kee"])</script><script nonce="HV0XM4lwilzOt0YtHEUUBg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"p sensitive files, packages, and services in your own infrastructure, or use a managed provider.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]},{\"kind\":\"row\",\"key\":\"d90d5b099fc8\",\"title\":\"Dreaming\",\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"22aaae5f8370\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"575b7f67b354\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Between sessions, Claude reflects on past runs and codifies what it learned as memory.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]},{\"kind\":\"row\",\"key\":\"e519913c9a31\",\"title\":\"MCP tunnels\",\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"3f78513083d1\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"41d372dea54b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Reach MCP servers in your private network without exposing them to the public internet.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]},{\"kind\":\"row\",\"key\":\"2ee2093c12e3\",\"title\":\"Vaults\",\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"0efed6d2eb3a\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"24783a759d67\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Keep secrets out of your agent code. Register a credential once and reuse it across sessions.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]}]}]]}]\n5b:T545,\u003cpath d=\"M10 1.99121C10.4707 1.99121 10.9712 2.13317 11.3516 2.45508C12.1747 3.15161 13.5508 3.99292 15.5518 4.20117C16.3217 4.28129 17 4.90867 17 5.75V9.98438C16.9998 12.3468 15.8083 14.5499 13.8311 15.8428L10.8213 17.8105C10.3226 18.1366 9.67739 18.1366 9.17871 17.8105L6.16895 15.8428C4.19174 14.5499 3.00016 12.3467 3 9.98438V5.75C3 4.90867 3.67835 4.28129 4.44824 4.20117C6.44918 3.99292 7.82531 3.15161 8.64844 2.45508L8.79688 2.34277C9.15386 2.09996 9.58822 1.99121 10 1.99121ZM10 2.99121C9.75034 2.99121 9.52329 3.0588 9.36035 3.16895L9.29492 3.21875C8.35364 4.01531 6.7943 4.9629 4.55176 5.19629C4.22301 5.2305 4 5.48676 4 5.75V9.98438C4.00016 12.0093 5.02198 13.8977 6.7168 15.0059L9.72656 16.9736C9.89274 17.0822 10.1073 17.0822 10.2734 16.9736L13.2832 15.0059C14.978 13.8977 15.9